From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 07:03:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: cpufreq: apple,cluster-cpufreq: Add T8132

The T8132 (M4) cluster performance controllers are matched by
apple-soc-cpufreq as apple,t8132-cluster-cpufreq, with the generic
apple,cluster-cpufreq fallback. Allow that pair, as aurora-silicon's
integration/aurora already does for its T8132 boards.

Link: https://github.com/aurora-silicon/linux/commit/b811bfe35d
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/cpufreq/apple,cluster-cpufreq.yaml       | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpufreq/apple,cluster-cpufreq.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpufreq/apple,cluster-cpufreq.yaml
index a27f4314e0..a7bc5697ca 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpufreq/apple,cluster-cpufreq.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cpufreq/apple,cluster-cpufreq.yaml
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - apple,t8103-cluster-cpufreq
               - apple,t8112-cluster-cpufreq
+              - apple,t8132-cluster-cpufreq
           - const: apple,cluster-cpufreq
       - items:
           - enum:
